Step 3: Open threat_detector.py

Delete everything if it contains anything.

Paste this code:

def detect_cpu(cpu):

    if cpu > 90:
        return "HIGH"

    return "NORMAL"


def detect_ram(ram):

    if ram > 90:
        return "HIGH"

    return "NORMAL"


def detect_disk(disk):

    if disk > 95:
        return "HIGH"

    return "NORMAL"

Save it.

Stop Here!

Don't run anything yet.

